kQQ"/></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-fvxzrP bFKOnZ pf-26_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO"><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-27_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-28_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gWXbKe iZtXJr pf-29_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-31_">See Why 3,000 People Gave This Cool Tech “⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ “ On Amazon</span></h2><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-32_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-34_">We’re willing to bet you’ve taken A LOT of photos and videos over the past few years.<br>Vacations. Beach days. Barbeques.<br><br>Weddings. Anniversary parties. Graduations, etc. etc. etc.<br><br>Each one of these moments was special in their own way. Years from now, you’ll be able to look back and enjoy them like they just happened yesterday.<br><br><span style="text-decoration-line: underline;">Well, only if you treat your memories like you intend to keep them. </span><br><br>What do we mean?<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Think about where those memories are saved right now.</span> For most families, the answer is “all over place.”<br><br>Some are on our phones. A few on our tablets. A bunch still sitting in our cameras and computers.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">The fact is, you’re almost guaranteed to lose SOMETHING that way.</span><br><br>5,761 phones are broken EVERY HOUR….<br><br>….over 140,000 hard drives <span style="font-weight: bold;">CRASH </span>in the U.S. EVERY WEEK….
<br><br>...and many camera memory cards end up being irretrievably lost.&nbsp;<br><br></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iUKqMP cXeOPA pf-35_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-42677cec--Add-a-heading-23.png?v=1627075244" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-42677cec--Add-a-heading-23.png?v=1627075244 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-42677cec--Add-a-heading-23_500x.png?v=1627075244 320w" width="900" height="543" class="sc-caiLqq hgIkQQ"/></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-fvxzrP bFKOnZ pf-36_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO"><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-37_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-38_"><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-39_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-41_">If something happens to any one of your devices, you might not even realize what you’ve lost for months...or even years.<br><br>Scary, right? That’s why a few years ago, a tech-startup in the U.S. decided to come up with an affordable solution. <br></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-fvxzrP bFKOnZ pf-42_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO"><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-43_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-44_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gWXbKe iZtXJr pf-45_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-47_">The best part? It’s super simple to use – just three easy steps!<br></span></h2><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-48_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-50_"><span style="font-weight: bold;"><br>Step One: </span>Download ThePhotoStick App for FREE in the Google Play Store and Apple Store.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Step Two: </span>Plug one end of the adapter into the USB stick and plug the other end into your device. ThePhotoStick App will begin finding and sorting through all of the photos and videos stored onto your device.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Step Three:</span> Remove the adapter from the USB stick and plug into your computer's USB port.
</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-51_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-52_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gWXbKe iZtXJr pf-53_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-55_">By now you’ve probably seen an ad for “ThePhotostick” on social media.&nbsp;</span></h2><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-56_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-58_"><br>Since it launched, ThePhotostick has been the preferred choice by millions for protecting photos and videos.<br><br>No wonder it’s gotten over 3,000 five-star reviews on Amazon (more on those later!)<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">This crowd favorite has gotten a massive upgrade for 2021</span> – and it’s launching at <a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self">an incredible discount right out of the gate….&nbsp;</a></span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-59_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-60_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gWXbKe iZtXJr pf-61_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-63_">It’s called ThePhotoStick Omni.
<br></span></h2><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-64_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-66_"><br>Like the original ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐-rated Photostick,  <b><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self">ThePhotoStick Omni</a></b> lets you save tens of thousands of photos and/or videos.<br><br>Here’s the difference: With ThePhotostick Omni, you can find all the photos or videos <span style="font-weight: bold;">taken on all your devices</span>, and protect them in one, organized place.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-67_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-68_"><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iUKqMP cXeOPA pf-69_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-470c47f7--ThePhotoStick-Omni-Horizontal-Edited?v=1627076129" class="sc-caiLqq hgIkQQ"/></a></div></div></div><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-70_ pf-r" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-71_"><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-72_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-74_">Never worry about running out of storage space, or losing any of your memories ever again!<br><br>Here are five reasons why <span style="font-weight: bold;"><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self">ThePhotostick Omni</a></span>&nbsp;is a must-have in every home:<br></span></p><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-75_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-77_">1. <span style="font-weight: bold;">It works with practically ANY device.</span><br>2. <span style="font-weight: bold;">It actually deletes Duplicates!</span> The PhotoStick sifts through your images and removes duplicates, but don’t worry—if two images are similar, it will save both (and won’t delete the one with your eyes open!)<br>3. <span style="font-weight: bold;">Space for countless memories.</span> PhotoStick saves up to 60,000 photos.<br>4. <span style="font-weight: bold;">Pay once for continuous protection.</span> ThePhotoStick works as a backup and keeps your images safe, without the worry of a lifetime of&nbsp;<br>5. <span style="font-weight: bold;">Save time!</span> PhotoStick saves photos automatically, so spend your time how you want to</span></p><p class="sc-eGRUor iAsKXf pf-78_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-80_">Now you can safely back up photos and videos - instantly!<br><br>With<span style="font-weight: bold;"> <a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self">ThePhotoStick Omni</a></span>, you can save tens of thousands of photos and/or videos and never have to worry about running out of storage space, or losing any of your memories!&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-81_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-82_"><div data-pf-type="HTML.Video" class="sc-cidDSM lkVECx pf-83_"><video width="100%" height="auto" type="video/mp4?v=1626132422" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/Attach-adapter-to-USB-stick--1-.mp4?v=1626132422" loop="" playsinline="" autoplay="" controlsList="nodownload" disablepictureinpicture=""></video></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-84_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-hOGkXu krzkQM pf-85_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gWXbKe iZtXJr pf-86_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jHkVzv dyVEVs pf-88_">Will ThePhotoStick Omni fit my device?
