en I had my first camera phone so I wouldn't have lost so many pictures of my kids, other family, and friends, and important events." ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ - Sharon&nbsp;<br><br>"The Photo Stick works just the way it says it does; very easy to use. I checked it when done, and there were my pictures. There is so much room on the stick that I should be able to use it for years to backup documents and pictures." ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ - Linda Wilson<br><br>"Much better price and product worked just as expected. I have some irreplaceable pictures, I feel so much better knowing they are stashed on this and safe in a fire proof box." ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ - Sage<br><br>"My home is filled with all types of electronic devices but I have NEVER received one that is so totally simple to use like the Photostick 128. Just inserted into computer's USB port &amp; clicked GO &amp; that was it. It searched, detected &amp; then stored over 14,000+ photos &amp; videos as a safe backup resource for those important memories. After all that it still has a vast storage ability remaining." ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ - Deer Whisperer<br><br>"I wasn't sure with the reviews how my luck would be with this, but it works like a charm!It was just enough to get all my photos with just a little room left. I kinda wish I bought the largest one now, as if I bought a 2nd it wouldn't take the overflow, it would start over I guess. Maybe I will buy the bigger one later, and keep this 128G one as backup when it is filled. Go for it! Just put it in the USB slot and click and go! Nice!" ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ - HMWalsh<br><br>"Absolutely amazing. Does exactly what it said it would do. Copied photos and videos from my daughter's old computer that she was throwing away. Was able to retrieve pictures since engagement, wedding, and birth of her children. I will buy another for my Mac and one for my other daughter." ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ - Patricia Davidsmeier<br></span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-bBHxTw QejWU pf-106_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs: